<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova Oct industry output falls 27.4 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Moldova Oct industry output falls 27.4 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's industrial output in October fell 27.4 percent on a year-on-year basis, the State Statistics Department said on Friday.</p>
<p>    MOLDOVAN INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION  Oct '96   Sept '96   Oct '95</p>
<p>    Monthly pct change		   +41.1	-14.1     +18.7</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	    -27.4	-36.9	+6.9</p>
<p>Industrial output fell 7.3 percent in the first 10 months of this year, compared with a 7.9 percent fall in the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
